Package: CIRI
Type: Package
Title: CIRI CRISPR Screen Analysis Pipeline
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Alessandro", "Bertero", role = c("aut")),
    person("Maria Luisa", "Ratto",  role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "ratto@example.com")
  )
Description: End-to-end analysis pipeline for CIRI single-cell CRISPRa/i
    screens. Covers guide name harmonisation, perturbation assignment with
    KDE-based auto-thresholding, Seurat-based QC, Monocle3 preprocessing,
    cluster enrichment, pseudotime statistics, and gene signature scoring.
    Standalone scripts for QC and filtering are included in inst/scripts/.
